Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:02:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Always show Individual, Group and Free trial sections; warn
 when past individual dates were cleared

- About page: Individual session card is always shown (with a note when no
  individual times are open)
- Booking page: Individual is always listed; opens on the first type that
  has times
- Dashboard: notice when saved one-to-one dates have all passed so saving
  would hide Individual sessions
---
